{"product_id":"extreme-silent-kill","title":"Extreme : Silent kill","description":"\u003cp\u003eNorthern Ireland, 1993. For high-flying MI5 officer Avery Chance the real war has only just begun. When Chance is abducted by the IRA's notorious Nutting Squad, her hopes lie in the hands of a young SAS recruit who must risk everything to bring her home. Twenty years after his act of self-sacrifice in Belfast, ex-SAS legend John Bald is a scarred shadow of his former self.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:26 x 235  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Chris Ryan \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781444756876 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Trade Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 342\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44768451362969,"sku":"16RC-2-9781444756876","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/e08a9f0e3f739a919bfa4c9e412066ea.jpg?v=1724248467","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/extreme-silent-kill","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}